    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-02-36",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "鹤，一足，赤文青质而白喙，名曰毕方，其鸣自叫也，见则其邑有讹火。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-06-07",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "毕方鸟在其东，青水西，其为鸟人面一"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-06-08",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "人面有翼，鸟喙，方捕鱼。一曰在毕方东。或曰朱国。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 11,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-11-15",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "西南隅，以东，又北，又西南，过毕方鸟东。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 15,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-15-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "怪也。山出枭阳，水生罔象，木生毕方，井生坟羊，人怪之，闻见鲜而识"
    }
  ],
